  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Understanding adverse drug reactions to dolutegravir and isoniazid in HIV-positive Ugandans: incidence, risk factors, management and patient-reporting</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MRC ARL to improve the health of PLHIV in Uganda through understanding the population-specific incidence, characteristics and risk factors for ADRs and embedding ADR-reporting by PLHIV in Uganda&apos;s healthcare system</narrative>
  </description>
